<title>USA: Decorator Industries Inc Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Decorator Industries Inc Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>PEMBROKE PINES, Fla. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>For Quarter Ended</p>
<p>				Mar 29, 1997*	     Mar 30, 1996*</p>
<p> Net sales		     $9,386,543		  $9,439,498</p>
<p> Net income			 702,606		     622,726</p>
<p>Primary earnings</p>
<p> per share			     0.30		     0.27</p>
<p>Fully diluted</p>
<p> earnings per share		  0.28		     0.25</p>
<p>Average number of</p>
<p> shares outstanding	   2,373,213		2,307,885</p>
<p>NOTE:  Earnings per share and the average number of shares outstanding have been restated to reflect four-for-three stock split in June 1996.</p>
<p>The first quarter of 1997 includes the results for the previously announced acquisitions of Specialty Windows and Action Design.</p>
</text>
